{"symbol":"BOW.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:47:45Z","info":{"address1":"ul. Niwecka 1E","city":"Sosnowiec","zip":"41-200","country":"Poland","phone":"48 32 392 9300","fax":"48 32 392 9380","website":"https://www.bowim.pl","industry":"Steel","industryKey":"steel","industryDisp":"Steel","sector":"Basic Materials","sectorKey":"basic-materials","sectorDisp":"Basic Materials","longBusinessSummary":"Bowim S.A. engages in distribution of carbon steel products in Poland, rest of the European Union, and internationally. The company offers steel products, including hot rolled plates and sheets, cold rolled, and galvanized coils and sheets; reinforcement steel, such as rebars and round bars, as well as round, square and flat bars; wire rods, ribbed wires, welded wires, and welded reinforcement mesh made of ribbed wire; conduit, structural, boiler, and general purpose tubes; precision tubes; welded tubes; cold bent and hot rolled section products, including equal and unequal angles, U-channels, half-closed channels, square and rectangular hollow sections, economical U-channels, H-beams, and wide-flange beams; and reinforcing prefabricated products. It also provides black and insulated pipes; and pipe fittings for pipelines. In addition, the company offers steel services comprising shearing cold rolled galvanized/aluminum-zinc coated/electrogalvanized steel sheets and strips, and hot rolled pickled and oiled steel sheets and strips; production of open steel profiles; and slitting and rewinding of cold rolled galvanized/aluminum-zinc electrogalvanized steel coils. Further, it operates a rebar shop and a laboratory for testing; and provides transport services. The company serves gas engineering, petroleum chemistry, water pipes, and power engineering markets. Bowim S.A. was founded in 1995 and is headquartered in Sosnowiec, Poland.","fullTimeEmployees":306,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Jerzy  Wodarczyk","title":"Vice President of the Management Board, 